These files are vendored so that the preview harness in tools/preview can
rasterize using the firmware's own scanline fill and line routines instead of
an approximation of them. They are not part of the watchface: nothing under
src/ links against this directory, and the .pbw build does not see it.

No vendored file has been edited. Everything needed to compile them against a
host framebuffer lives outside this directory, in tools/preview/raster/shim/,
which is original work under the repository's own licence.
